---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ContactSection from '../../components/ContactSection.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Brazos Ridge Fence Co. | Waco Ranch Fence Builders"
  description="Brazos Ridge Fence Co. builds farm and ranch fencing across Waco and Central Texas. Honest pricing, free written estimates, and fence built to hold cattle."
  canonical="https://brazosridgefence.com/about/"
>
<Fragment slot="head">
<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "BreadcrumbList", "itemListElement": [{"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://brazosridgefence.com/"}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "About", "item": "https://brazosridgefence.com/about/"}]}</script>
<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "FAQPage", "mainEntity": [{"@type": "Question", "name": "What areas does Brazos Ridge Fence Co. serve?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "We're based in Waco and cover McLennan, Bosque, and Falls counties. That includes China Spring, Crawford, McGregor, Valley Mills, Lorena, West, and the ranch country in between. If you're close to that footprint, call us and we'll tell you straight whether we can get to you."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "What kinds of fence do you build?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Farm and ranch fence is all we do. That means barbed wire, pipe fence, high game fence for deer and exotics, and custom ranch entrance gates. We don't chase subdivision privacy fence work, so our crews stay sharp on the fencing that working land actually needs."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "How do estimates work?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Estimates are free and always in writing. We walk your fence line with you, talk through terrain, gates, and materials, then put per-foot pricing on paper so you can compare it against anybody. There's no charge and no pressure to sign on the spot."}}]}</script>
<style is:global>
  .rich p { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #555; margin: 0 0 16px; }
  .rich ul { padding-left: 20px; margin: 0 0 16px; }
  .rich li { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #555; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .rich strong { color: #2E2A25; }
  .rich a { color: #C68A2E; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; }
  .rich a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
</style>
</Fragment>

<section style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, #08344B 0%, #0E4D6E 65%, #08344B 100%);padding:72px 24px;">
  <div class="hero-grid" style="max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 0.9fr;gap:56px;align-items:center;">
    <div>
      <span style="display:inline-block;margin-bottom:12px;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:999px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;background:rgba(143,208,234,0.18);color:#8FD0EA;border:1px solid rgba(143,208,234,0.3);">About Us</span>
      <h1 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-weight:800;color:#fff;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-0.01em;font-size:clamp(30px,4.4vw,52px);margin:0 0 18px;">Fence Builders Who Know Ranch Country</h1>
      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">We build farm and ranch fence across Waco and Central Texas. Straight lines, tight wire, honest numbers, and a crew that picks up the phone.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;">
        <a href="tel:+15093518404" class="btn-cream">Call Now — (509) 351-8404</a>
        <a href="#contact" class="btn-outline-white">Get a Free Estimate</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-img" style="border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 24px 48px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);">
      <img src="/images/about.webp" srcset="/images/about-800.webp 800w, /images/about.webp 1200w" sizes="100vw" alt="Fence Builders Who Know Ranch Country" width="800" height="533" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  @media (max-width: 860px) { .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; } .hero-img { max-height: 320px; } }
</style>
<section style="padding:72px 24px 40px;"><div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;"><div class="rich"><p>Brazos Ridge Fence Co. is a farm and ranch fencing outfit based in Waco, Texas. We work the same country our customers do, from the river bottoms along the Brazos to the limestone hills out toward <a href="/fence-builder-crawford/">Crawford</a> and <a href="/fence-builder-valley-mills/">Valley Mills</a>. Our whole business is fence for working land: pastures, hay ground, hunting places, and homesteads across McLennan, Bosque, and Falls counties.</p><p>We got into this work because we saw too many landowners paying good money for fence that sagged in two summers. A fence is only as good as its corners, its brace posts, and the crew that stretched the wire. So we build <a href="/barbed-wire-fence-waco/">barbed wire</a>, <a href="/pipe-fence-waco/">pipe fence</a>, <a href="/game-fence-installation-waco/">high game fence</a>, and <a href="/ranch-entrance-gates-waco/">ranch entrance gates</a> the way they ought to be built, set deep and stretched tight.</p><p>We keep the business side just as straight as the fence lines. Every job starts with a free written estimate that spells out your cost per foot, your materials, and your timeline, with no surprises tacked on at the end. If you want to see how pricing works before you ever call us, our <a href="/ranch-fence-cost/">ranch fence cost guide</a> lays out real numbers.</p><p>We're licensed and insured, and we answer the phone when things go wrong, not just when there's a sale to make. Storm takes down a fence line or cattle get out at 2 a.m., our emergency line at (509) 351-8404 is open around the clock. That's what it means to be a neighbor in this business, and we aim to earn that word on every job.</p></div></div></section>
<section style="padding:0 24px 64px;"><div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="kicker">How We Work</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);margin:0 0 28px;">What You Can Expect</h2>
    <div class="feat-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#2A2724;margin:0 0 8px;">Built to Hold</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Corners set in concrete, braces done right, wire stretched tight. We build fence to outlast the note on the truck that hauled it in.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#2A2724;margin:0 0 8px;">Straight Numbers</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">You get a free written estimate with real per-foot pricing before we drive a single post. The price we quote is the price you pay.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#2A2724;margin:0 0 8px;">We Know Cattle</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">We fence for the animal, not just the property line. Wire spacing, gate placement, and corner layout all come from time spent around livestock.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#2A2724;margin:0 0 8px;">There When It Matters</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Our 24/7 emergency line covers storm damage and cattle-out calls. When your fence is down, waiting until Monday isn't an option.</p>
      </div>
</div>
<style>
  @media (max-width: 860px) { .feat-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; } }
</style>
  </div></section>
<section style="padding:72px 24px;background:#F5EDDF;">
  <div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="kicker">FAQ</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(24px,3.5vw,36px);margin:0 0 32px;">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:8px;padding:24px 28px;">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#2A2724;margin:0 0 10px;">What areas does Brazos Ridge Fence Co. serve?</h3>
        <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;margin:0;">We're based in Waco and cover McLennan, Bosque, and Falls counties. That includes China Spring, Crawford, McGregor, Valley Mills, Lorena, West, and the ranch country in between. If you're close to that footprint, call us and we'll tell you straight whether we can get to you.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:8px;padding:24px 28px;">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#2A2724;margin:0 0 10px;">What kinds of fence do you build?</h3>
        <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;margin:0;">Farm and ranch fence is all we do. That means barbed wire, pipe fence, high game fence for deer and exotics, and custom ranch entrance gates. We don't chase subdivision privacy fence work, so our crews stay sharp on the fencing that working land actually needs.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:8px;padding:24px 28px;">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#2A2724;margin:0 0 10px;">How do estimates work?</h3>
        <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;margin:0;">Estimates are free and always in writing. We walk your fence line with you, talk through terrain, gates, and materials, then put per-foot pricing on paper so you can compare it against anybody. There's no charge and no pressure to sign on the spot.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, #0E4D6E 0%, #16648C 50%, #0E4D6E 100%);padding:64px 24px;text-align:center;">
  <h2 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(26px,4vw,40px);font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin-bottom:16px;">Need Help in Central Texas? Call for Same-Day Service.</h2>
  <p style="font-size:16px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);margin-bottom:28px;max-width:520px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;">Free written estimates. Emergency calls answered around the clock.</p>
  <div style="display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
    <a href="tel:+15093518404" class="btn-cream">Call Now — (509) 351-8404</a>
    <a href="#contact" class="btn-outline-white">Get Free Estimate</a>
  </div>
</section>

<ContactSection />

</Layout>
